{"product_id":"buture-x9-vacuum-cleaner","title":"Buture X9 Cordless Vacuum | 600W 50KPA 60min Runtime","description":"\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"h2\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmh1e4c632pi5h\",\"jc\":\"left\",\"spacing\":{\"before\":21.333333333333332,\"after\":9,\"line\":0.8529411764705882}},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":16,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"New Release! Master pet messes with the Buture X9 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner. 🐶🐶\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbstd18qhpx7md2dmlu\",\"jc\":\"left\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Its tangle-free brush roll and multi-surface capabilities simplify pet cleanup. Embrace effortless pet fur, dust, and debris cleanup with a cordless stick vacuum designed for pet-tailored home care.  \"]]],[\"h3\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmhol0nevf6rj\",\"jc\":\"justify\",\"spacing\":{\"before\":18.666666666666664,\"after\":8,\"line\":0.8529411764705882}},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":14,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"🐾 Powerful Pet Messes Cleanup\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmigjppxqpjg2f\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Advanced 600W motor delivers exceptional 50 kPa suction power, easily remove pet fur everywhere and clean pet food spills and muddy paw prints from kitchens and busy entrance ways. Effortlessly transition from carpeted surfaces to hard floors, all while enjoying powerful suction for the ultimate clean.\"]]],[\"h3\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmi9tf04fsl3ld\",\"jc\":\"justify\",\"spacing\":{\"before\":18.666666666666664,\"after\":8,\"line\":0.8529411764705882}},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":14,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"🐾 Simple Pet Hair Removal\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmiv5e5yi9umvk\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Conquer pet hair removal with Buture X9 Vacuum tangle-free brush roll, which minimizes hair wrap and clogging while you clean, and a crevice tool, which uses powerful suction to remove fur, hair, dust, and debris from tight spaces.\"]]],[\"h3\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmiubnp64u6rc\",\"jc\":\"justify\",\"spacing\":{\"before\":18.666666666666664,\"after\":8,\"line\":0.8529411764705882}},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":14,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"🐾 Multi-layer Filtration System and Allergen Trapping\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmjffu0cx7i9dm\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"Arial\"},\"sz\":12,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"The Buture X9 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner features a multi-layer filtration system that ensures a clean, allergen-free environment. With filters like HEPA, stainless steel, and sponge filters, it captures particles of all sizes for a more thorough cleaning process.\"]]],[\"h3\",{\"uuid\":\"mbsspbmjywew6qvb2bk\",\"jc\":\"justify\",\"spacing\":{\"before\":18.666666666666664,\"after\":8,\"line\":0.8529411764705882}},[\"span\",{\"data-typ